        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DOREX Double Cylinder Deadbolt </b>\r\n<p>\r\nSatin stainless steel finished Double Cylinder Deadbolt (keyed on both the outside and inside). Deadbolt supplied with adjustable latch bolt for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets. Supplied with Square Corner and Drive-in latch bolt face plates.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Double Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from both exterior and the interior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for DOREX Satin Stainless Steel Double Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>5 Pin Weiser Keyway</li>\r\n<li>1\" Deadbolt with Hardened Steel Core for Extra Security</li>\r\n<li>Fit Standard 2-1/8\" Pre-Drilled Doors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the DOREX 4660 Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\n<b>** Clearance Priced,  limited quantities available. \r\n<br><br>\r\nOnly 2 Deadbolts Left.\r\n</b>\r\n</p> -->\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>**Sold Out. </b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
